{"version":1,"content":"<p>TikTok 開始向全球符合條件的創作者和用户分階段推出肖像檢測功能，該功能主要幫助創作者和知名人士發現並舉報平台上出現的、未經同意使用本人肖像的 AI 內容。TikTok 還向公眾開放 AI 檢測工具，該工具可以檢測音視頻和圖像是否是 TikTok 旗下工具生成的。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587744.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.422835+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:35:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"0ec35861668aaf8e72d769c46284a9658e4a29c2a9d6f9f1ebe9932e5dedd2d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}